- `12_nbaAnalysisData.RData`: contains the data processing results of `11_nbaAnalysis_dataProcessing.Rmd`. We can use this data in the next step (for example, visualization in a new file `21_nbaAnalysis_visualization.Rmd`), by loading it via `load("12_nbaAnalysisData.RData")`. 

